Blair Vision adapts integration patterns from:

  Jev Browser Control (https://github.com/nexibeo/jev-browser-control)
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Jeroen Erne
  -> the Jev "decisions" request/response contract (choice questions, probability
     distributions, usage.cost), strict distribution validation, provider endpoints
     (TypeSafe direct, OpenRouter alpha decisions, Jev Browser Control credits),
     retry/error handling, and the "page text is untrusted data" rules wording.

  Jev for Chrome (https://github.com/chy4pro/jev-for-chrome) was inspected as a second
  reference for the same contract; no code was copied from it.

"Jev" and "System One" are products of TypeSafe; this project is not affiliated with them.
